    "detailed_description": "The story of an elderly bedridden man who is approaching the end of his life and is burdened with life's hardships and disappointments. In his altered and fading memories, he imagines himself as a little boy named Griffin who finds solace in the company of a teddy bear that embodies the spirit of his deceased son.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1542110/extras/53c031feecac97527076ffac8cc39039.poster.avif?t=1721205481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1542110/extras/53c031feecac97527076ffac8cc39039.webm?t=1721205481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Trying to evade the ever-present grasp of Death itself, you will meet the most important characters of Griffin\u2019s life in this mysterious world: a cruel and harsh father who turned into a giant knight, and a fragile but protective mother embodied in the form of a flower fountain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1542110/extras/8462195a2bca4dff923f60b69c339409.poster.avif?t=1721205481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1542110/extras/8462195a2bca4dff923f60b69c339409.webm?t=1721205481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Travel through a mysterious world of craggy caves and floating castles, fairytale forests and rolling plains. Prepare to be enthralled by the captivating world of Daydream, discover the transformative power of resilience, and accept the bittersweet beauty of letting go.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features</h2> <br>\u2014 Dive deep into a sprawling story, revealing secrets and unravelling the mysteries of an enchanting narrative;<br><br>\u2014 Step into an unforgettable world accompanied by dreamy melodies and mesmerizing music;<br><br>\u2014 Encounter memorable characters, such as the endearing young Griffin and his steadfast teddy bear companion Birly;<br><br>\u2014 Command an adorable teddy bear friend who assists you along the journey;<br><br>\u2014 Collect all memory moths to help Griffin find peace.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1542110/extras/e99e97f35431441d93759b80305b6acb.poster.avif?t=1721205481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1542110/extras/e99e97f35431441d93759b80305b6acb.webm?t=1721205481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "The story of an elderly bedridden man who is approaching the end of his life and is burdened with life's hardships and disappointments. In his altered and fading memories, he imagines himself as a little boy named Griffin who finds solace in the company of a teddy bear that embodies the spirit of his deceased son.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1542110/extras/53c031feecac97527076ffac8cc39039.poster.avif?t=1721205481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1542110/extras/53c031feecac97527076ffac8cc39039.webm?t=1721205481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Trying to evade the ever-present grasp of Death itself, you will meet the most important characters of Griffin\u2019s life in this mysterious world: a cruel and harsh father who turned into a giant knight, and a fragile but protective mother embodied in the form of a flower fountain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1542110/extras/8462195a2bca4dff923f60b69c339409.poster.avif?t=1721205481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1542110/extras/8462195a2bca4dff923f60b69c339409.webm?t=1721205481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Travel through a mysterious world of craggy caves and floating castles, fairytale forests and rolling plains. Prepare to be enthralled by the captivating world of Daydream, discover the transformative power of resilience, and accept the bittersweet beauty of letting go.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features</h2> <br>\u2014 Dive deep into a sprawling story, revealing secrets and unravelling the mysteries of an enchanting narrative;<br><br>\u2014 Step into an unforgettable world accompanied by dreamy melodies and mesmerizing music;<br><br>\u2014 Encounter memorable characters, such as the endearing young Griffin and his steadfast teddy bear companion Birly;<br><br>\u2014 Command an adorable teddy bear friend who assists you along the journey;<br><br>\u2014 Collect all memory moths to help Griffin find peace.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1542110/extras/e99e97f35431441d93759b80305b6acb.poster.avif?t=1721205481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1542110/extras/e99e97f35431441d93759b80305b6acb.webm?t=1721205481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Experience the altered memories of a dying man, reliving his entire life as a little boy while lying on his deathbed. Explore the profound depths of his subconscious as you assist Griffin to shed the remains of his miserable life before his impending demise.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Thai, Turkish, Traditional Chinese, Georgian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cIt is an immersive journey through friendship, self-discovery, and life's intricacies, promising a rich and impactful experience that remains with players long after the game ends.\u201d<br>\u2014 Spieltimes<br><br>\u201cThe story and gameplay seem simple at first but leave you with some deep thoughts once you finish the game.\u201d<br>\u2014 Impulse Gamer<br><br>\u201cThe character design for both Griffin and Birly are adorable, meaning I felt very protective of both as they made their way through a sometimes cruel world.\u201d<br>\u2014 Games Creed<br>",
